<!--
  SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

  Entitlements for release builds, which scripts/sign-app.sh signs with the hardened runtime.
  The app needs no entitlements: it is not sandboxed, links the Rust core statically, and uses
  no JIT, unsigned executable memory, DYLD environment variables or third-party libraries, so
  no hardened runtime exception applies. get-task-allow is absent, as notarization requires.
  See docs/release-macos.md before adding a key here.
-->
